---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "0.98beta"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " Quit/Exit "
---#sp      = h     "space "
sp      = iv    -       -       -       -     "[space]"


---SCREEN                                     
=generic keyboard help
+LINLIB/VISI                                             
+(c) 1986-1990 vsv        line control:                                            
+                          ."line type/sample".....  ."key".  ."action"......           
+common keys:              menu item:                                                  
+ .:HE... get help                 .mse............  .:SP...  select                   
+ .:EX... exit page                                  .:NL...  select optional                  
+ .:RE... refresh page     selector/toggler:                                                   
+ .:CA... cancel                   .alt2.            .:SP...  toggle forward           
+ .:AU...                                            .:DE...  toggle backward          
+ .:AD...                  variable:                                        
+ .:AL...                          .var.....         .:SP...  keep content  
+ .:AR...                                            .:DE...  erase         
+                         line editing:                                    
+optional:                 ."action"...............  ."key". ."alternative".
+ .:TA...                  commit changes            .:NL...                
+ .:KD...                  Ins/Ovr mode              .:KI... .:PR... .:PR...
+ .:KH...                  erase left from cursor    .:DE...                
+ .:KE...                  erase below cursor        .:KD...                
+ .:PU...                  erase up to end                   .:PR... .:SP...
+ .:PD...                  jump to 1st symbol        .:KH... .:PR... .:AL...
+                          jump to end of text       .:KE... .:PR... .:AR...

---END
                        
 LINLIB/VISI          
 1986-1990 (c)                               


."control keys:"..................     
 - select menu item:       .:SP...     
 - start line editing:                 
     * keep content        .:SP...     
     * clear before edit   .:DE...     
 - selector cycle/toggle:              
              * forward    .:SP...     
              * backward   .:DE...     

 ."all page control keys"................

 - Get help                .:HE...
 - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
 - Refresh screen          .:RE...
 
 - Page context navigation:   
   * to next line:       .:TA... 
   * arrow keys, 
   .:KH... .:KE... .:PU... .:PD...
       









   ."line types".................
 
   .var....... - editable string
   .alt2.         - selector
   .mse............ - menu item
 
  - Get help                .:HE...
  - Exit, end of the page   .:EX...
  - Refresh screen          .:RE...
 
 - Move to next line.... .:TA... 
 - Navigation:
 .:AU... .:AD... .:AL... .:AR... 
